{look
    {message
        output={@

You see a strange man.
He is wearing a long black trench coat and half of his face is covered in
circuit boards. He is bald and portions of his head are made of chrome plates
that have been bolted into his skull.

He comes up to you and says,
"Oh! You are new here!
I can offer you an exploit, free of charge - all I ask is that you keep me in
mind, should you find something that might be of use to me.

I can give you an invisibility exploit.
It always works on people who are new to Shellspace, however the longer people
have been here, the more likely it is they have devised their own exploits to
counter-act your invisibility, so that Shellspace still renders you as they
look around."

"Do you want this exploit?"

        }
    }

    {logic
        logic={@
            ?[room]((topic)) = 'greeting'
        }
    }

    {set, logic=[room]((topic)), output=offer }
}
